### ==============================================================================
### Campus Events Platform — API Test Suite & Verification Checklist
### Base URL: http://localhost:3001/api
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api
@apiKey = campus-secret-key-2026

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### TEST 1: GET All Events (Expected: 200 OK)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name getAllEvents
GET {{baseUrl}}/events HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### TEST 2: Filter by Category (Expected: 200 OK with matching category)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name filterByCategory
GET {{baseUrl}}/events?category=technology HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### TEST 3: Filter by Publication Status (Expected: 200 OK, only published events)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name filterByPublished
GET {{baseUrl}}/events?isPublished=true HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### TEST 4: Sort and Paginate (Expected: 200 OK, page 1 with 3 events sorted by date)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name sortAndPaginate
GET {{baseUrl}}/events?sortBy=eventDate&order=asc&page=1&limit=3 HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### TEST 5: Get Upcoming Events (Expected: 200 OK, events dated today or later)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name getUpcomingEvents
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/upcoming HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### TEST 6: Get Existing Event by ID (Expected: 200 OK)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name getExistingEvent
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/1 HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### TEST 7: Get Missing Event (Expected: 404 Not Found)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name getMissingEvent
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/999999 HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### TEST 8: Get Event Sessions (Expected: 200 OK with related session array)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name getEventSessions
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/1/sessions HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### TEST 9: Create Valid Event (Expected: 201 Created with valid API key)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name createValidEvent
POST {{baseUrl}}/events HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "title": "Intro to Cloud Computing",
  "description": "A beginner-friendly campus workshop on cloud infrastructure.",
  "location": "Engineering Block, Room 2",
  "eventDate": "2026-12-04T09:00:00.000Z",
  "category": "technology",
  "isPublished": true
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### TEST 10: Create Invalid Event (Expected: 400 Bad Request, empty payload)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name createInvalidEvent
POST {{baseUrl}}/events HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### TEST 11: Middleware Request Logging Verification (Expected: Logged in terminal)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name testMiddleware
GET {{baseUrl}}/events HTTP/1.1

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### TEST 12: Guard Authentication Check (Expected: 401 Unauthorized without API key)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name testGuardUnauthorized
POST {{baseUrl}}/events HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Unauthorized Hackathon",
  "description": "Should fail before reaching controller",
  "location": "Campus Center",
  "eventDate": "2026-12-10T10:00:00.000Z",
  "category": "technology",
  "isPublished": true
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### TEST 13: Interceptor Timing & Header Verification (Expected: X-Response-Time header)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name testTimingInterceptor
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/published HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### TEST 14: ParseIntPipe Parameter Validation (Expected: 400 Bad Request for non-integer)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name testParseIntPipe
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/example?page=hello HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### TEST 15: ValidationPipe DTO Property Validation (Expected: 400 Bad Request, invalid date)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name testValidationPipe
POST {{baseUrl}}/events HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "title": "Robotics Expo",
  "description": "Annual student robotics competition.",
  "location": "Main Gymnasium",
  "eventDate": "not-an-iso-date",
  "category": "technology",
  "isPublished": "not-a-boolean"
}
